description: |
  Retrieves the list of override assets for an AppSec application. Returns all manual asset
  additions and removals grouped by override action, including the user who performed each
  change, the operation type (ADD or REMOVE), the action ID that can be used to revert
  the override, and the affected asset IDs together with their resolved asset names.
  Either application_id or application_name must be provided (but not both).
display: Cortex - Get Override Assets
isdetailsoverridden: false
locked: false
